{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coppy Tour is a side-scrolling arcade adventure with the goal of collecting all coins, targets, and hidden items spread across the Coppy Tour 2D world.\u00a0 It is a classic &quot;High-Score&quot; competition, with an online leaderboard and unlimited playability.\u00a0 Control your player through the course to collect coins, while using your gun to collect targets.\u00a0 Hidden coins and pickups may require several playthroughs to find or access.\u00a0 With a run duration under 30-minutes, you can attempt to beat your high score frequently, though legend has it nobody has ever completed with 100% of the items collected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new weapons, skins, item customizations, and map features through in game decisions.\u00a0 Learn the levels to maximize your score each run and find all unlockable items.\u00a0 In-depth stats menus keep track of your achievements, with runs saving automatically and several gameplay options to choose from.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Money Maker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4003340/b621aa85a1289628a85380383fb9375572461d59.jpg"},{"name":"Deep Secrets","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4003340/7ed5540c8578ed9ed3eaef014f9660a5fadbc4fb.jpg"},{"name":"20,000!!!!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4003340/98f6efdd73a5726f348636c48964e77aff429ada.jpg"},{"name":"Decent!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4003340/b3216be788d5b523756d63556173f3b60d0a2e85.jpg"},{"name":"Welcome!!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4003340/0a9e9b09830c0bc564499ed0c62c6002d562fba4.jpg"},{"name":"  Somewhat impressive...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4003340/9e53af3f03890a5e8e3b97b4f5c2f14c416c349a.jpg"},{"name":"Nice!!